oxy anisole, l-ascorbyl palmitate, para di-methoxy benzene, and ortho methoxy toluene. In addition, the company offers pharmaceutical and agro intermediates, which includes dicyclohexyl carbodiimide, veratrole, DHDT, para benzoquinone, para di-methoxy benzene, anisole, and ortho methoxy toluene. It serves acrylic monomers and polymers; animal nutrition and feed; coatings, resins, paints, and inks; cosmetic and personal care; electronics and electronic chemicals; edible oils; flavors and fragrances; food and beverages; fuel, lubricants, and industrial fluids; nutraceuticals and dietary supplements; petrochemicals; peptide and fine chemicals synthesis; pharmaceuticals intermediates; plastics; rubber and elastomers; light/UV stabilizers; and water treatment industries. The company was incorporated in 2003 and is headquartered in Pune, India.","beta":0.425,"sharesOutstanding":106284121,"marketCap":76524568576,"trailingPE":32.8617,"forwardPE":23.1932,"priceToBook":4.5799,"enterpriseToEbitda":20.592,"dividendYield":0.83,"heldPercentInsiders":0.5521,"heldPercentInstitutions":0.2391,"earningsGrowth":0.006,"revenueGrowth":0.224,"website":"https://cleanscience.co.in","fullTimeEmployees":396,"recommendationKey":"buy","targetMeanPrice":913.8571,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":14,"financialCurrency":"INR"},"estimates":{"eps":{"0q":{"avg":null,"low":null,"high":null,"yearAgoEps":null,"numberOfAnalysts":null,"growth":null,"currency":"INR","methodology":"normalized"},"+1q":{"avg":null,"low":null,"high":null,"yearAgoEps":null,"numberOfAnalysts":null,"growth":null,"currency":"INR","methodology":"normalized"},"0y":{"avg":23.8917,"low":22.6,"high":25.5,"yearAgoEps":21.6,"numberOfAnalysts":12.0,"growth":0.1061,"currency":"INR","methodology":"normalized"},"+1y":{"avg":31.0435,"low":27.3,"high":36.6,"yearAgoEps":23.8578,"numberOfAnalysts":13.0,"growth":0.3012,"currency":"INR","methodology":"normalized"}},"revenue":{"0q":{"avg":2896000000.0,"low":2868000000.0,"high":2924000000.0,"numberOfAnalyst